        "ratings": [
            {
                "comment": "Constance was honestly one of my favorite professors I have ever had! She has a true passion for gaming and encourages discussion amongst students. She loves to hear your opinions! There are 5 papers, but they are all relatively fun to write and she will help you in anyway possible! Take whatever you can with her!!",
                "difficulty_rating": 1,
                "quality_rating": 5
            },
            {
                "comment": "This class is really easy and pretty fun. It's about videogames and the grading is based on 4 short papers and 1 long paper which basically if you finish them, you'll do well. Best Comm B I could ask for.",
                "difficulty_rating": 1,
                "quality_rating": 5
            },
            {
                "comment": "She was one of the greatest, funnest teachers I had. She's clearly passionate about her subject and provides surprising, informative data during her lectures that as someone who plays video games I did not know but wanted to know. She's super approachable, and the comments here don't paint an accurate picture of her in my opinion. TAKE HER CLASS!!!",
                "difficulty_rating": 2,
                "quality_rating": 5
            },
            {
