                "difficulty_rating": 1,
                "quality_rating": 3
            },
            {
                "comment": "She doesn't know what she is talking about. Now and then she parrots something she saw in Wired or in Slash dot.  Press her on anything and she ends up telling some rambling story about the stickers on her computer, how she does her hair, or who hit on her at a conferce.  She does enjoy talking about how smart she is.  Bleh.",
